# Default 60 s screen timeout: the screen sleeps, the key that wakes it does
# nothing else, and an incoming message wakes it too (when set to).
# both-modes
# A message wakes the screen only when set to (LED only is the default). With the lock off any
# key wakes it; with it on, G0 does (test/scenarios/cardputer-sleep.sim).
pref lock off
pref notify screen
node Ivy 7
as Ivy advert
wait 3000
key menu
key down 3
key enter
wait 2000
hold esc 900
key right
shot timeout-before
wait 61000
expect screen off
key right
expect screen on
shot timeout-woken-same-tab
wait 61000
expect screen off
as Ivy dm Cardputer ping
wait 3000
expect screen on
